# 本地依赖、构建和测试产物不随源码发布。
**/node_modules/
**/target/
/ui/dist/
/ui/dist-*/
/ui/*.tsbuildinfo
/ui/playwright-report/
/ui/test-results/
/ui/.impeccable/review/
/ui/.impeccable/mocks/

# 私有配置、业务备份和开发证据只保存在本地。
**/.runtime/
**/.planning/
**/.tmp/
**/logs/
**/.impeccable/
**/.impeccable-live*/
**/.impeccable-live*
**/backups/
**/exports/
*.log
*.log.*
*.bundle
*.sql.gz
*.sql.bak
*.dump
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.private.yml
*.private.yaml
*secrets*.yml
*secrets*.yaml
!*secrets.example.yml
!*secrets.example.yaml

# 本机文件管理器元数据。
.DS_Store

# 本机 IDE、联调脚本和验收证据不随源码发布。
.idea/
.vscode/
/.run/*
!/.run/HrPlatformApplication.run.xml
/task_plan.md
/findings.md
/progress.md
/ui/playwright.*-local.config.ts
/ui/e2e/*.live.ts
/ui/design-qa*.md
/ui/docs/primary-navigation/selected-reference.png
